{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack Battle is a high-mobility multiplayer first-person shooter where movement is everything. Build speed by skiing across terrain, launch into the air with your jetpack, and use momentum to outplay opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is skill-driven and rewards precision, timing, and smart positioning. There are no gimmicks or power creep\u2014success comes from mastering movement and working with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack- and skiing-based movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-focused gunplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic multiplayer modes like Capture the Flag and Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective-driven, team-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated modding with the UE editor for extreme mods</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack Battle is designed for players who want fast, fun FPS gameplay centered on movement mastery.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2434060?t=1768846168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768846168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768846168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768846168","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack Battle is a high-mobility multiplayer first-person shooter where movement is everything. Build speed by skiing across terrain, launch into the air with your jetpack, and use momentum to outplay opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is skill-driven and rewards precision, timing, and smart positioning. There are no gimmicks or power creep\u2014success comes from mastering movement and working with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack- and skiing-based movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-focused gunplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic multiplayer modes like Capture the Flag and Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective-driven, team-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated modding with the UE editor for extreme mods</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack Battle is designed for players who want fast, fun FPS gameplay centered on movement mastery.</p>","developers":["Jesse Watson"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434060/header.jpg?t=1768846168","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434060/625984/e35b2eade26160751d95faa41f78822f1cc2df6a/1750918635/dash_av1.mpd?t=1699232382","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434060/625984/e35b2eade26160751d95faa41f78822f1cc2df6a/1750918635/dash_h264.mpd?t=1699232382","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434060/625984/e35b2eade26160751d95faa41f78822f1cc2df6a/1750918635/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1699232382","id":256980155,"name":"Duel Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256980155/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1699232382"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2434060/623730/4850cc3e173daf057e58796bdee15c5174076585/175